{"parentUuid":"79e64fee-3f43-4822-9c21-c2b50147ea44","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgizwrArphgY4WxhLb1ih","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've added that split to `docs/badges.md`, committed and pushed as `9c234fe`, and saved it in Entire Brain.\n\n| Layer | Lives in | Owns |\n|---|---|---|\n| Sealing | Descartes | Computing the result and sealing it into the badge: the check, the digests, the embedded reference, signing |\n| Design | Praxis | What a badge looks like and must carry: visual form, metadata schema, the rules, shared by every Praxis output |\n| Use | not yet named | Which badges to issue, where they're embedded and hosted, how long a status lasts |\n\nI heard \"ceiling\" as \"sealing\" and wrote it that way. Tell me if you meant something else.\n\n`docs/badges.md` stays in this repo as the design draft until it moves to Praxis. I haven't put it there myself: Praxis has a few hundred staged files from another session, and its producer contract is being edited.\n\nWhere should the \"use\" layer live: Dark, the Praxis site, each publishing project, or somewhere else?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2134,"cache_read_input_tokens":223661,"output_tokens":335,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2134,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":335,"cache_read_input_tokens":223661,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2134,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2134},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5d913bd3-2309-472e