{"parentUuid":"3e952ec5-4093-4fe4-9b9b-ad93f5abfaff","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01Pjn8ptAr4oTppFM26gSg9A","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"bf6e1857-157c-42ca-adab-f6d5f2ffeb3c","timestamp":"2026-11-05T02:58:24.949Z","session_id":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","sessionId":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"ec-ai-corpus","slug":"calm-crunching-lovelace"}
{"parentUuid":"bf6e1857-157c-42ca-adab-f6d5f2ffeb3c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgj2npAXb3BiYkkmhCXsz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've opened **Entire trail #29** for this: \"Badges: durable citations and expiring status (sealing in Descartes, design in Praxis, use TBD)\".\n\n**Why a trail and not a PR or a plan edit:**\n- **No PR route:** `dark-monocloud`'s remote is Entire, not GitHub.\n- **The central plan file can't be edited safely:** it's staged but uncommitted by another session, on another session's branch, with about 15,000 uncommitted changes in that checkout.\n- **No issue route:** Forgejo isn't connected in this session.\n\nSo the trail stands in for the plan edit, and it points at the plan.\n\n**What the trail holds:**\n- **Decided:** the two kinds of badge (durable citations, expiring status) and the three-way split (sealing in Descartes, design in Praxis, use not yet named).\n- **Where the draft is:** `docs/badges.md`, which moves to Praxis once Praxis's staged work lands.\n- **The plan already constrains this, and the trail quotes it:**\n  - Line ~2296 says a failed or unavailable check \"cannot produce a verified-citation badge\".\n  - Line ~396 says a project summary must show unresolved items \"instead of compressing everything into a green badge\".\n\n  Our design fits both: a failing claim gets a \"fails\" badge, and the paper gets a set of badges rather than one summary badge.\n- **Five questions for the central plan:**\n  1. where the use layer lives;\n  2. how long a status badge stays valid;\n  3. hosting for the badges and the pages they click through to;\n  4. signing, which waits on the Praxis signing-key question (`OPENQUESTIONS.md` Q1);\n  5. when to build the Descartes `badge` command, after its open branch merges.\n\n`docs/badges.md` now points to trail #29, and the trail snapshot that the PDF appendix reads includes it. Committed and pushed as `c480459`. Whoever next commits the central plan should copy the trail's questions into it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":991,"cache_read_input_tokens":231127,"output_tokens":660,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":991,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":660,"cache_read_input_tokens":231127,"cache_creation_input_tokens":991,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":991},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5022cec2-97e7-47d1-abc3-0acee6e90abc","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgj2nozccuZJrXJcgJxuP","requestRef":"8ddeb9fc-8bc5-438f-9a03-c39bc3c4b245","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1a0efdd1-f5e2-42ab-bbc6-e8f453da7a39","timestamp":"2026-11-05T02:58:24.948Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","sessionId":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"ec-ai-corpus","slug":"calm-crunching-lovelace"}
