{"parentUuid":"1fb4b654-8a3a-4525-8a38-72b6d2dbf12c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"756ac6bc-5cfc-4be2-9d8e-f6738f60edbb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Well, like the idea if the idea is like You know i if the if the if it's I mean think about it like make or taker economics in what's it called in markets right like you know there's we're trying to seed in epistemic commons and if you do that you should be rewarded for providing liquidity. We should have always a set of questions ready for people about various things, if for no other reason than to get their data on how various different things relate to each other, right? Or, if they have any, or you know, or like, if they've, or if they've thought about their, like, the scope of their scope of control and what activism opportunities would they have, and how we can help. Like, I mean, that would be an important thing to know if they wanted to tell us. Like, complete your graph. Complete your note on the graph..But, you know, I feel like writing to a local, like taking the taking the data locally and not giving it back and not giving back what you do with it is not giving back, right? Because the idea is that the thing gains from disagreement and gains from exploration.... So, we need ways to reconcile multiple divergent approaches, but also centralize thinking"},"uuid":"a6aacf58-509b-479e-ac6b-f9a47057178e","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:04:57.903Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":106,"turnIndex":137},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","sessionId":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"ec-ai-corpus","slug":"calm-crunching-lovelace"}
