Descartes's loss measure; k is a parameter Sloane sets (an editorial override).\n   b. Charge for what is lost: the graph value of the source's uncovered spans, priced like covered value.\n   c. Tiered: coverage bands set the price tier, which is simpler to explain.\n   Each needs coverage measured on real CDP-vendor pairs first; the formula should be chosen after seeing the distribution, not before.\"\"\")\nopen(p,\"w\",encoding=\"utf-8\").write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -c \"Flattening raises the price\" $S/trail-commons.md; cd /Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc && entire trail update 30 --project et/ec1c --body \"$(cat $S/trail-commons.md)\" >/dev/null 2>&1; echo rc=$?","description":"Record CDP as first test and flattening-raises-price on trail #30"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"113578f0-d270-4c52-8880-7e2b17a30fae","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgj92RS9UrCJYn9jcm8GW","requestRef":"1c1111f4-0c8e-471f-9a60-0eb9052f1839","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f0317a69-3db6-46ec-b20a-e6bcf8e18738","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:20:21.992Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","sessionId":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"ec-ai-corpus","slug":"calm-crunching-lovelace"}
