ssive. | **+56.1%** | **High** | Voss 2021 |\n228:| **Words Indicating Risk** | Unusual frequency of “averse,” “avoid,” “concern,” “difficulty,” “prevent”? | Risk words proactively excised by frauds. If still high, major red flag. | **+55.9%** | **High** | Voss 2021 |\n229:| **Impersonal Pronouns** | Excessive use of “another,” “everybody,” “someone,” “whichever”? | Emotional distance = deception signal. Trying to separate self from message. | **+54.1%** | **High** | Voss 2021 |\n230:| **Words Indicating Difference** | Does communication compare/contrast? “Compared with,” “as opposed to”? | TRUTHFUL firms use MORE comparison words. Liars focus on single narrative. | **-53.6%** (honest use MORE) | **High** | Voss 2021 |\n231:| **Words That Negate** | High frequency of “not,” “never,” “should not,” “does not,” “must not”? | Deceivers more negative. But not always reliable (some honest firms also negative). | **+50.4%** | **Medium** | Voss 2021 |\nls: cannot access '/home/hermeswebui/.hermes/webui/attachments/20260531_201131_51c06c/': No such file or directory\n/workspace/wt-t_1a7b4c3c/docs/wiki/ethical-capital-harkness-wiki-map.md\n/workspace/wt-t_1a7b4c3c/spikes/001-mental-model-wiki-enrichment/generated_pages/Ethical-Capital-Harkness-Wiki-Map.md\n/workspace/worktrees/sprb-praxis-gallery/docs/wiki/ethical-capital-harkness-wiki-map.md\n/workspace/worktrees/sprb-praxis-gallery/spikes/001-mental-model-wiki-enrichment/generated_pages/Ethical-Capital-Harkness-Wiki-Map.md\n/workspace/wt-t_16cfb39f/docs/wiki/ethical-capital-harkness-wiki-map.md\n/workspace/wt-t_16cfb39f/spikes/001-mental-model-wiki-enrichment/generated_pages/Ethical-Capital-Harkness-Wiki-Map.md\n/workspace/dark-praxis/.worktrees/t_2546091f/spikes/001-mental-model-wiki-enrichment/generated_pages/Ethical-Capital-Harkness-Wiki-Map.md\n/workspace/dark-praxis/.worktrees/t_8d90c688/spikes/001-mental-model-wiki-enrichment/generated_pages/Ethical-Capital-Harkness-Wiki-Map.md\n/workspace/dark-praxis/.worktrees/t_280