links. Original prompt IDs and\ntext remain intact; `data/provenance.json` records the source digest. This is\nnot the internal question queue. Private research records, browser history,\nsource rankings, company allegations and synthetic activity are excluded.\n\nOptional JavaScript filters existing records and changes their order using\nthree attention controls. These are reading lenses, not ethical or credibility\nscores. No query or contribution is sent by this script. The question directory\nand all question pages work without JavaScript. Contributor accounts and an\nanswer/review workflow remain in development.\n\n```sh\npython3 -B commons/build.py\npython3 -B -m unittest discover -s commons -p 'test_*.py'\npython3 -B commons/install.py --target ../monocloud-<worktree>/website/public/praxis\n```\n\nThe builder rejects unselected fields, URLs and output files. The installer\nverifies every manifest digest and refuses an altered destination. Generated\nassets are copied byte for byte, without formatting. Source changes require\nregeneration, review of the selected content and a new verified installation.\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d105c546-0c3e-4d34-ba70-17a541a6bb26","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:59:39.440Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"__pycache__\nacceptance.json\nbrowser-check.cjs\nbuild_env.py\nbuild.py\nclose-production-pr.json\ncommons-desktop.png\ncommons-mobile.png\ncommons.css\ncommons.js\n M commons/README.md\nM  commons/acceptance.json\nMM commons/build.py\nA  commons/close-production-pr.json\n M commons/commons.css\nM  commons/templates/home.html\nMM commons/templates/page.html\nMM commons/test_public_projection.py\n?? CONTRIBUTION-PROTOCOL.md\n?? commons/data/contribution-review.json\ncommons\ncommons/build.py\ncommons/commons.css\ncommons/firm-mobile.png\ncommons/test_public_projection.py\ncommons/acceptance.json\ncommons/firm-pr.json\ncommons/__pycache__\ncommons/README.md\ncommons/commons-mobile