ion(s) | Action Required | Source |\",\"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\",row3m,rowL,\"\",\"*Restored 2026-11-04 at Sloane's request. The rest of the business-model section is kept in held.md.*\",\"\",\"---\",\"\",\"\"])\nm=m.replace(anchor,sec+anchor)\nopen(\"models.md\",\"w\",encoding=\"utf-8\").write(m)\nprint(\"held lines\",len(out))\nEOF\nmkdir -p missing && cat > missing/ethical_capital_harkness_syllabus_v2.pdf.missing.md <<'EOF'\n# MISSING: ethical_capital_harkness_syllabus_v2.pdf\n\nThis stub stands in for a file we know existed and cannot find. A `.missing.md`\nstub keeps the gap visible: anything that depends on the file points here, and\nthe stub says what is known, where it was last seen, and what was searched.\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Name | `ethical_capital_harkness_syllabus_v2.pdf` |\n| What it is | Sloane Ortel's syllabus for a Harkness-method course to be taught with Jason Voss |\n| Last seen | Attached to a Hermes web chat on 2026-05-31; the attachment directory no longer exists |\n| Digest | Unknown (never recorded) |\n| Depends on it | The week outline in README.md (only 9 of at least 17 week titles survive); weeks 02–04, 06–08, 13 and 15 |\n| Searched, 2026-11-04 | This Mac (Spotlight, by name and content), the R2 staging copy, darkchive, Zotero, the Hermes server, local Claude Code transcripts, Honcho shared memory |\n| Not yet searched | Sloane's claude.ai conversation history; Google Drive; the private Forgejo wiki |\n| Status | open |\n\nWhen it is found: pin it (bytes and SHA-256), record where it came from, fill the\nmissing weeks from it, and mark this stub `found` with the digest; the stub stays\nas the record of the gap.\nEOF\npython3 -I - <<'EOF'\np=\"README.md\"; s=open(p,encoding=\"utf-8\").read()\ns=s.rstrip(\"\\n\")+\"\"\"\n\n## Held and missing\n\n- **held.md** keeps everything removed from this set, verbatim, so that nothing is deleted. It is held for Sloane and Jason Voss to unify, and stays out of any public release until then.\n- **missing/** holds `.missing.md` stubs for files we know existed but can't find. The original syllabus is one: `missing/ethical_capital_harkness_syllabus_v2.pdf.missing.md`.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,\"w\",encoding=\"utf-8\").write(s+\"\\n\")\np=\"PROVENANCE.md\"; s=open(p,encoding=\"utf-8\").read()\ns=s.rstrip(\"\\n\")+\"\"\"\n\n## Revision, 2026-11-04 (Sloane's review)\n\n- Nothing is deleted. Every removed span is kept verbatim in held.md, by source line range.\n- \"Analyst's 3 Rights\" and \"Leverage Amplifies\" are restored to models.md (section XIc, general models). Sloane attributes \"Analyst's 3 Rights\" to Mike Mayo; the source said \"Unknown\", and the attribution cell says both.\n- The lost syllabus is recorded as a missing-file stub in missing/.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,\"w\",encoding=\"utf-8\").write(s+\"\\n\")\nEOF\nls -R | head; grep -c \"\" held.md","description":"Write held.md verbatim, restore the two models, add the missing-file stub, update README and provenance"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"93405a8f-4c0e-4ab8-b467-a0471aa8ee50","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgjCStWqVmTt4hqvs6BX1","requestRef":"d44e76cc-fd9b-4398-8cc7-788cd97d9e6c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2b941dff-eaa6-45c9-8940-58f8eaeb8f41","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:05:16.613Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","sessionId":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"ec-ai-corpus","slug":"calm-crunching-lovelace"}
