s":7,"lines":[" |---|---|---|"," | Sealing | Descartes | Computing the result and sealing it into the badge: the check, the digests, the embedded reference, signing. A Rust command beside `check`. |"," | Design | Praxis | What a badge looks like and what it must carry: the visual form, the metadata schema, the rules on this page, shared by every Praxis producer. |","-| Use | still to be named (not this repository by default) | What to do with badges and the data behind them: licensing (a licensee uses it as agreed; no unlicensed commercial use) through a standard handshake; working offline on an activist's phone with a local AI; which badges to issue, hosting, how long a status lasts. Direction and design notes: Entire trail #29. |","+| Use | the dark repository | What to do with badges and the data behind them. Its decisions are privileged and are discussed only in the dark repository. |"," "," The prototype (`~/tray/argument-check-badges.html`, 2026-11-04) was a"," throwaway script and belongs to none of them. This page is the design draft"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc/AGENTS.md","/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc/docs/badges.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"f1994cd6-6662-4f8b-b32a-e25cb0220b2b","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","root":"/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","branch":"ec-ai-corpus","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":5,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":14},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"srvo/anthropic-pbc","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"srvo/anthropic-pbc","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"srvo/anthropic-pbc","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ea5ac8ce-f207-4240-bb5e-67012