{"parentUuid":"fc99c34a-5863-4602-a230-ba18690a2412","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b332a665-a152-463b-867b-815cac8956f6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Ho918V7aTSz4KQYkz4Hj3","type":"tool_result","content":"## inbox-first — Deliver a usable lightweight local Inbox\n\nPriority 3 · proposed · revision 12 · [trail #15](https://entire.com/et/ec1c/-/trails/15)\nOwner: unassigned\nReason: Selected first Tauri surface; retain actual callers\nUnverified prerequisites: none recorded (not proof of readiness)\nAcceptance: Measure receive latency and footprint; prove submit/read/recovery across selected platforms\nEvidence: not yet recorded\n\n## structured-intake-workflow-v1 — Own structured-first intake and bounded after-run reconciliation\n## structured-intake-workflow-v1 — Own structured-first intake and bounded after-run reconciliation\n\nPriority 3 · proposed · revision 6 · [trail #4](https://entire.com/et/ec1c/-/trails/4)\nOwner: unassigned\nReason: Owner-requested intake; not an optimized priority score\nUnverified prerequisites: none recorded (not proof of readiness)\nAcceptance: Versioned source, explicit unresolved checks, scoped write/readback evidence; no inferred factual approval\nEvidence: not yet recorded\n\n## sustainability-opportunity-model — Model opportunity cost and sustainable capacity\n\nPriority 2 · proposed · revision 5 · [trail #24](https://entire.com/et/ec1c/-/trails/24)\nOwner: unassigned\nReason: Foregone revenue and impact matter alongside spend\nUnverified prerequisites: none recorded (not proof of readiness)\nAcceptance: Version scenarios for fees by jurisdiction, launch cost, deal value/probability/cash timing, mission fit, delivery capacity, compliance and self-care. Preserve evidence and uncertainty; show assumptions to Kevin without private-data leakage. No fabricated revenue or regulatory amounts.\nEvidence: not yet recorded\n\n## after-run-cluster-adapter-v1 — Install bounded after-run receipts and reconciliation on cluster runners","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"2acc5be8-5558-4078-bcf0-cbf8085d58af","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:15:36.318Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## inbox-first — Deliver a usable lightweight local Inbox\n\nPriority 3 · proposed · revision 12 · [trail #15](https://entire.com/et/ec1c/-/trails/15)\nOwner: unassigned\nReason: Selected first Tauri surface; retain actual callers\nUnverified prerequisites: none recorded (not proof of readiness)\nAcceptance: Measure receive latency and footprint; prove submit/read/recovery across selected platforms\nEvidence: not yet recorded\n\n## structured-intake-workflow-v1 — Own structured-first intake and bounded after-run reconciliation\n## structured-intake-workflow-v1 — Own structured-first intake and bounded after-run reconciliation\n\nPriority 3 · proposed · revision 6 · [trail #4](https://entire.com/et/ec1c/-/trails/4)\nOwner: unassigned\nReason: Owner-requested intake; not an optimized priority score\nUnverified prerequisites: none recorded (not proof of readiness)\nAcceptance: Versioned source, explicit unresolved checks, scoped write/readback evidence; no inferred factual approval\nEvidence: not yet recorded\n\n## sustainability-opportunity-model — Model opportunity cost and sustainable capacity\n\nPriority 2 · proposed · revision 5 · [trail #24](https://entire.com/et/ec1c/-/trails/24)\nOwner: unassigned\nReason: Foregone revenue and impact matter alongside spend\nUnverified prerequisites: none recorded (not proof of readiness)\nAcceptance: Version scenarios for fees by jurisdiction, launch cost, deal value/probability/cash timing, mission fit, delivery capacity, compliance and self-care. Preserve evidence and uncertainty; show assumptions to Kevin without private-data leakage. No fabricated revenue or regulatory amounts.\nEvidence: not yet recorded\n\n## after-run-cluster-adapter-v1 — Install bounded after-run receipts and reconciliation on cluster runners","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage"